{"id":"8109ed862a1b5d55","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Extender Sequence","display":"df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence — ZFC Model7 Extender Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence — ZFC Model7 Extender Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence — ZFC Model7 Extender Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c11b408c5a26a920\" href=\"?note=c11b408c5a26a920\" title=\"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender\">58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E,M,\\lambda,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\nu\\in V\">\\(\\vec E,M,\\lambda,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\nu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S\\)</span> (extender predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c11b408c5a26a920\" href=\"?note=c11b408c5a26a920\" title=\"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender\">58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\lambda,M)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\kappa,\\nu\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(\\vec E(\\alpha),\\kappa,\\nu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\lambda,M)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\kappa,\\nu\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(\\vec E(\\alpha),\\kappa,\\nu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an ordinal sequence in a transitive ZFC model whose entries are actual extender codes with critical and length parameters in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Fine-structural coherence is deliberately left to the separate extender-sequence coherence predicate; the unsourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtenderOver}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtenderOver}\\)</span> placeholder is removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender","status":"resolved","id":"c11b408c5a26a920","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S$ (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender","status":"resolved","id":"c11b408c5a26a920","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S$ (extender predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec E,M,\\lambda,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\nu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\lambda,M)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\exists\\kappa,\\nu\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(\\vec E(\\alpha),\\kappa,\\nu)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtenderOver}","display":false}],"bytes":1657,"backlinks":[{"id":"1e645227245eab34","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ExtenderSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (model extender-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2778","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-model7-extender-sequence]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751","a9132c2c1a18acd1","c11b408c5a26a920"]}